Description: Boosting supported network analysis for high-dimensional omics applications.
    This package includes a portable reimplementation of the MC-UPGMA clustering
    algorithm by Yaniv Loewenstein (Loewenstein et al. 2008,
    <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btn174>).
